      "text": [
        "Action potentials travel to the   \ninterior of the muscle fiber   \nalong transverse (T) tubules,   \ninfoldings of the plasma   \nmembrane   \nThe action potential along T   \ntubules causes the   \nsarcoplasmic reticulum (SR),   \na specialized   \nendoplasmic reticulum, to   \nrelease $\\mathsf { C a } ^ { 2 + }$   \nThe $\\mathsf { C a } ^ { 2 + }$ binds to the troponin   \ncomplex on the thin filaments,   \ninitiating muscle fiber   \ncontraction "
